<details class="calendar-help" id="calendar-help">
  <summary>How do I add an event to my calendar?</summary>
  <ol>
    <li>Choose <strong>Add to calendar</strong> on an event. This downloads a small <strong>.ics calendar file</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>Apple Calendar or Outlook:</strong> open the downloaded file with your calendar app, choose a calendar, and confirm the event.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Calendar:</strong> on a computer, open Settings → Import &amp; export. Select the downloaded file, choose your calendar, and click Import. <a href="https://support.google.com/calendar/answer/37118" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google’s import instructions ↗</a></li>
  </ol>
  <p>Review the time and choose a duration before saving; end times have not been announced for the current events. Downloads are saved copies, so later changes on this website won’t automatically update your calendar.</p>
</details>
